<section class="section section--flush page-hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>Industries</h1></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">Industrial automation</h2><p>Since 2007 we have designed, integrated and commissioned automation on power plants, refineries, cement works and control rooms in Romania, Serbia, Kazakhstan and Russia.</p>
<div class="grid grid--2 point-grid">
<div><h3>Platforms in production</h3><p>Emerson Ovation, ABB 800xA and Industrial IT, Siemens PCS7, Yokogawa Centum VP, HIMA HIQuad and Triconex — documented to the same standards on every project, and held to the same test evidence.</p></div>
<div><h3>ISO 9001</h3><p>Quality management certified to ISO 9001 since 2009.</p></div>
</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">HomeMaster — modular smart home automation</h2><figure><img src="/assets/img/homemaster/product-lineup.png" alt="HomeMaster retail boxes for OpenTherm Gateway, Digital I/O, Analog I/O, Water Leak, MicroPLC and Energy Meter modules" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>HomeMaster retail boxes for OpenTherm Gateway, Digital I/O, Analog I/O, Water Leak, MicroPLC and Energy Meter modules</figcaption></figure>
<p>Our in-house DIN-rail brand: local logic on every module, RS-485 Modbus between devices, ESPHome and Home Assistant integration — no cloud required. Shop, configurator and docs at <a href="https://www.home-master.eu">home-master.eu</a>.</p>
<a href="/homemaster/" class="btn btn--primary">Learn More</a></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">Power generation</h2><figure><img src="/assets/img/projects/steam-turbine-generator-hall.jpg" alt="Hydro turbine and generator set in the machine hall" width="960" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Hydro turbine and generator set in the machine hall</figcaption></figure>
<p>We automate electricity and heat production — steam and gas turbines, boilers, HRSG, hydro, district heating and renewable dispatch — from control system design through commissioning and acceptance testing.</p>
<a href="/industries/power-generation.html" class="btn btn--primary">Learn More</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">Oil and gas</h2><figure><img src="/assets/img/projects/atex-zone2-barriers.jpg" alt="ATEX Zone 2 intrinsically safe isolating barriers in a control cabinet" width="960" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>ATEX Zone 2 intrinsically safe isolating barriers in a control cabinet</figcaption></figure>
<p>Refinery and gas plants need control systems that work in classified areas, keep the refinery supplied when the grid fails, and report emissions and efficiency to the people who act on the data. We design intrinsically safe I&amp;C, burner management and SIL-rated safety systems, and integrate process data into the plant DCS and historians.</p>
<a href="/industries/oil-and-gas.html" class="btn btn--primary">Learn More</a></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">Bulk material handling</h2><figure><img src="/assets/img/2024/08/10/cement_and_coal.jpg" alt="Bulk material handling and weigh batching plant" width="635" height="505" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Bulk material handling and weigh batching plant</figcaption></figure>
<p>Conveyors, bins, crushers, belt weighers and recipe dosing — the same control problems whether the material feeds a boiler, an asphalt plant or a concrete batching plant.</p>
<a href="/industries/cement-and-coal.html" class="btn btn--primary">Learn More</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">Industrial control center design</h2><figure><img src="/assets/img/projects/control-room-combined-cycle.jpg" alt="Combined-cycle plant control room with operator consoles and overview display" width="960" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Combined-cycle plant control room with operator consoles and overview display</figcaption></figure>
<p>ISYSTEMS AUTOMATION designs, manufactures and supplies control room equipment and operator furniture for LUKOIL Energy and Gas, Dalkia Termo Prahova and Nuclearelectrica. Layout, acoustics, lighting and reach distances are decided with the control system — an operator on the eleventh hour of a night shift still has to read the screen and hear the alarm.</p>
